  "rationale": "Add explicit predictive-unit specifications and a pointwise likelihood evaluator over the existing named likelihood graph. Complete nonoverlapping factor/observation partitions and conditioning metadata are validated before reporting. The same forward tape is shared without changing sampling laws, density Jacobians or reverse propagation; reporting stages finite outputs and preserves original failures. New APIs have scoped numerical and downstream coverage, without claiming completed interchange or predictive-comparison workflows.",
